<section class="section-padding-tight bg-slate-900">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 animate-on-scroll">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold mb-4">Two Possible Futures</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400">Same goal. Different path. You choose.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-0 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-700 animate-on-scroll">
      <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 md:p-10 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-slate-700">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">❌</span> Without a real pre-underwriting
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-400 text-sm md:text-base">
          <li>• You shop on a guess; real underwriting happens later.</li>
          <li>• You find a home, pay for inspection, then the lender says no.</li>
          <li>• You don't understand fee worksheets—you just sign.</li>
          <li>• You're passed between departments; your file gets lost.</li>
          <li>• Stress, wasted money, and sometimes a lost dream.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 p-8 md:p-10">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">✅</span> With Joanna & the Buyer's Edge
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700 text-sm md:text-base">
          <li>• You know exactly what you qualify for before you shop.</li>
          <li>• Your offer is backed by real underwriting—sellers take you seriously.</li>
          <li>• You understand every fee and option; you choose what's best.</li>
          <li>• One point of contact; questions answered fast.</li>
          <li>• Confidence, clarity, and a smooth path to keys.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center mt-12 animate-on-scroll">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Choose the Second Future — Book a Call</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
